        <article>

  
      

  <div>
    
            <div>  <div class="slices" >
  <outline-container><div class="wysiwyg wysiwyg--acre">  <div class="align-right p-4 w-full sm:w-1/2">
    
          <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/original_scaled_008000_320x_100/public/migrated/acre/magnifyingmap.webp?itok=xmnd2hcM 320w, /sites/default/files/styles/original_scaled_065000_2600x_100/public/migrated/acre/magnifyingmap.webp?itok=fThkE8y0 367w" type="image/webp" sizes="(min-width:1024px) 412px, (min-width:640px) 50vw, 100vw" width="367" height="545">
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/original_scaled_008000_320x_100/public/migrated/acre/magnifyingmap.jpg?itok=xmnd2hcM 320w, /sites/default/files/styles/original_scaled_065000_2600x_100/public/migrated/acre/magnifyingmap.jpg?itok=fThkE8y0 367w" type="image/jpeg" sizes="(min-width:1024px) 412px, (min-width:640px) 50vw, 100vw" width="367" height="545">
                  
<img loading="eager" srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/original_scaled_008000_320x_100/public/migrated/acre/magnifyingmap.jpg?itok=xmnd2hcM 320w, /sites/default/files/styles/original_scaled_065000_2600x_100/public/migrated/acre/magnifyingmap.jpg?itok=fThkE8y0 367w" sizes="(min-width:1024px) 412px, (min-width:640px) 50vw, 100vw" width="160" height="238" class="rounded-md w-full" src="/sites/default/files/styles/original_scaled_004000_160x_100/public/migrated/acre/magnifyingmap.jpg?itok=toc_jjfB" alt="magnifyingmap">

  </source></source></picture>



  </div>


<p>The <a aria-label="Precinct/District Lookup Map (link is external) Opens in new tab" href="https://apps.smcacre.org/PrecinctLookup/PrecinctWebApp_Secured.html" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Precinct/District Lookup Map">Precinct/District Lookup Map</a> is also available to locate precincts. See <a data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="14bf67c0-ebbb-40a6-bd88-2b49bf1f6b6f" href="/elections/precinctlookup" title="Precinct/District Lookup">Precinct/District Lookup</a> for information on how to search.</p>

<p>During an election, precincts can be consolidated and all results are shown under the consolidated precinct. For example, precincts 10001, 10002, and 10003 may all be consolidated and referred to only as precinct 10001. Consolidation is an election-specific process and is not permanent. If you don't see a specific precinct in the results, please review the precinct consolidation list under election results for that election.</p>

<p><em>Last updated August 2026.</em></p>

<p>Click on the name of an area to view the precinct map:</p>

